    "detailed_description": "<br><br><br><br>Roam around the catacombs, collect the cubes and avoid IT at all cost.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649790/extras/085c4909654993bdae35e4484b4efacb.avif?t=1719414608\" width=616 height=110 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect everything before it finds you</h2>Every maze comes with it's set of tasks you need to do before you can escape and move on. While doing so, avoid it at all cost.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649790/extras/4bd53abc5f0eea0ac311defe8ad29bde.avif?t=1719414608\" width=616 height=110 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >It lurks in the darkness</h2>Always listen to your radar. The closer it gets, the more frequent it emits a warning sound. As long as you are in a chase and it is following you, the radar display turns red.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649790/extras/730ad47155e1c6cddb711bd4bdb01957.avif?t=1719414608\" width=616 height=110 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Steam Item Drops<br></li><li>Survival &amp; Endless Gamemode<br></li><li>Intense Gameplay<br></li><li>Speedrun-able<br></li><li>Intelligent Enemy That Adapts<br></li><li>6 Unique Endless Modifier</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<br><br><br><br>Roam around the catacombs, collect the cubes and avoid IT at all cost.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649790/extras/085c4909654993bdae35e4484b4efacb.avif?t=1719414608\" width=616 height=110 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect everything before it finds you</h2>Every maze comes with it's set of tasks you need to do before you can escape and move on. While doing so, avoid it at all cost.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649790/extras/4bd53abc5f0eea0ac311defe8ad29bde.avif?t=1719414608\" width=616 height=110 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >It lurks in the darkness</h2>Always listen to your radar. The closer it gets, the more frequent it emits a warning sound. As long as you are in a chase and it is following you, the radar display turns red.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649790/extras/730ad47155e1c6cddb711bd4bdb01957.avif?t=1719414608\" width=616 height=110 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Steam Item Drops<br></li><li>Survival &amp; Endless Gamemode<br></li><li>Intense Gameplay<br></li><li>Speedrun-able<br></li><li>Intelligent Enemy That Adapts<br></li><li>6 Unique Endless Modifier</li></ul>",
